  "releaseNotes": "Firefly III API 6.7.0. New: ISearchApi.CountTransactions (/v1/search/transactions/count), IRulesApi.ValidateActionExpression (/v1/rules/validate-expression), IPiggyBanksApi.ListAccountByPiggyBank, ICurrenciesApi.GetDefaultCurrency and ListExchangeRatesByCurrency (/v1/currencies/{code}/cer), IAutocompleteApi.GetTransactionsWithMeta. Removed upstream and now [Obsolete] (server answers 404): GetCurrenciesCodeAC, GetPiggiesBalanceAC, GetTransactionsIDAC. Breaking: CronResult jobs are now lists of CronResultRow (one per user, with User), Telemetry is gone and ExchangeRates/BillNotifications/Webhooks were added; BasicSummaryEntry.LocalIcon was removed. AutocompleteAccount.AccountCurrency* and Autocomplete{Account,Bill,Budget}.Active are now required.",
